        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="e" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Person" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="e是一名研究人员，作为合著者参与撰写了题为《Tailored microstructure of EB-PVD 8YSZ thermal barrier coatings...》的研究论文 (Publication [15])。" />
