          <attvalue for="2" value="《Analyses of the gaseous species in halide-activated cementation coating packs》是一篇学术论文，由S. C. Kung与R. A. Rapp合著。该文于1989年发表在金属腐蚀领域的专业期刊《Oxidation of Metals》上。" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="{&quot;year&quot;: &quot;1989&quot;, &quot;volume&quot;: &quot;32&quot;, &quot;pages&quot;: &quot;89–109&quot;}" />
