      <node id="chunk-27d4439c082e1df0f703012a02b14ffb-e-12" label="An investigation of the oxidation resistance of platinum aluminide coatings produced by either high or low activity processes">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="An investigation of the oxidation resistance of platinum aluminide coatings produced by either high or low activity processes" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Paper" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="由Burnell-Gray、W. Y. Chan与R. Wing三位学者组成的作者团队。他们因共同撰写并发表了题为《An investigation of the oxidation resistance of platinum aluminide coatings...》的学术论文而知名，该论文研究了高/低活性工艺对铂铝涂层抗氧化性能的影响。" />
