      <node id="chunk-819db6cd818e9e8d5c81db94051547db-e-5" label="Effect of Pt incorporation on the isothermal oxidation behaviour of chemical vapour deposition aluminide coatings">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="Effect of Pt incorporation on the isothermal oxidation behaviour of chemical vapour deposition aluminide coatings" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Publication" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="Y. Zhang、J. A. Haynes、W. Y. Lee及其合作者是一组研究人员。他们于2001年在期刊《冶金与材料汇刊A》(Metallurgical and Materials Transactions, 32A)上发表了一篇研究论文，探讨了铂(Pt)的加入对铝化物涂层性能的影响。" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="{}" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="e-5" />
