        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="The control of the composition and structure of aluminide layers formed by vapour aluminising" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Publication" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="《The control of the composition and structure of aluminide layers formed by vapour aluminising》是一篇学术论文。该论文由A. Squillace、R. Bonetti、N. J. Archer与J. A. Yeatman共同撰写，并发表于学术期刊《Surface and Coatings Technology》。" />
