      <node id="chunk-632d29e490ba842c81dadf45a38731c6-e-8" label="Advanced thermal barrier system bond coatings">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="Advanced thermal barrier system bond coatings" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Material System" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="一种先进热障系统中的关键材料体系，作为粘合层，用于将热障涂层附着在镍基、钴基和铁基等多种合金基材上。" />
