      <node id="chunk-491e59c42061a40a1fe533ef4ec8d245-e-10" label="EB-PVD process and thermal properties of hafnia-based thermal barrier coating">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="EB-PVD process and thermal properties of hafnia-based thermal barrier coating" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Publication" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="一篇由K. Matsumoto、Y. Itoh和T. Kameda合著的科学论文，发表于《先进材料科学与技术》期刊。该论文题为《EB-PVD process and thermal properties of hafnia-based thermal barrier coating》，主要研究采用电子束物理气相沉积（EB-PVD）工艺制备的氧化铪基热障涂层的热性能。" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="{}" />
