        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="Advanced nickel alloys for coal-fired boiler tubing" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Publication" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="一篇由G. Smith与L. Shoemaker合著的学术文章，其标题为“用于燃煤锅炉管道的先进镍合金”(Advanced nickel alloys for coal-fired boiler tubing)。该文章发表于《先进材料与工艺》(Advanced Materials and Processes)期刊。" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="{&quot;year&quot;: &quot;2004&quot;}" />
