      </node>
      <node id="chunk-b18667fadfdf7cfdf2bd35cc10bf1f84-e-3" label="Jet Propulsion: A Simple Guide to the Aerodynamic and Thermodynamic Design and Performance of Jet Engines">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="Jet Propulsion: A Simple Guide to the Aerodynamic and Thermodynamic Design and Performance of Jet Engines" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="Publication" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="《喷气推进》是由尼古拉斯·坎普斯蒂（N. A. Cumpsty）撰写的经典教科书。该书全名为《喷气推进：喷气发动机空气动力学和热力学设计及性能的简单指南》，是航空航天工程领域的权威著作，系统阐述了喷气发动机的设计原理与性能。" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="{&quot;year&quot;: &quot;1997&quot;}" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="e-3" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="chunk-b18667fadfdf7cfdf2bd35cc10bf1f84" />
