        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="CONTAINS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Superalloys contain significant amounts of chromium." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Based upon nickel, but containing significant amounts of at least ten other elements including chromium and aluminium, the superalloys are high-temperature materials which display excellent resistance to mechanical and chemical degradation at temperatures close to their melting points." />
