        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_A" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="A superalloy with a homologous temperature of ~0.75 is classified as a high-temperature material." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Thus, a superalloy operating at 1000 °C in the vicinity of the melting temperature of nickel, 1455 °C, working at a τ of (1000 + 273)/(1455 + 273) ~ 0.75, is classified as a high-temperature material." />
