        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="CONSISTED_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The No 9 combustor can was constructed from 11 pieces of the superalloy Hastelloy X." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="The origin of the failure was a 360° separation of the No 9 combustor can (see Figure 1.8), which consisted of 11 pieces of the superalloy Hastelloy X in sheet form, welded together" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-1" />
