          <attvalue for="11" value="INFLUENCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The text requires an investigation into how the Overall Pressure Ratio (OPR) affects thermal efficiency (Nth)." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="investigate how the thermal efficiency, Nth, depends upon the TET and the OPR." />
