        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_DEFINED_BY" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Efficiency (η) is defined as the ratio of useful work to heat absorbed (QAB)." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="The efficiency, η, defined as the ratio of the useful work obtained, W, to the heat absorbed from the heat source, QAB, is given by η = W/QAB" />
