        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="GOVERNS_CALCULATION_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The temperature T₃ is calculated based on the relationship for an adiabatic, reversible process." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="For an adiabatic, reversible process one has T₃/T₁ = (p₃/p₁)^((γ-1)/γ) and since the pressure ratio p₃/p₁ = 25, this yields T₃ = 723 K if T₁ = 288 K." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-1" />
