        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_DEFINED_BY" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The useful work (W) is defined by a consideration of four integrals of the form ∫ p dV." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="this follows from a consideration of the four integrals, ∫ p dV, defining W." />
