        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="HEATS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The gas stream at 1500 °C is in contact with the outer surface of the blading, which has a temperature of 1000 °C." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="in a gas stream of temperature 1500 °C. The metal temperatures at the outer and inner (cooled) surfaces are 1000 °C and 800 °C, respectively" />
