        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="USES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The bypass design is a feature of a modern civil aeroengine." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Such calculations, although simplistic, can be used to justify the use of the bypass design for a modern civil aeroengine" />
