          <attvalue for="11" value="DEVELOPS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The core of the engine develops useful work." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Most of the useful work developed by the core of the engine is used to accelerate a much greater mass of air through a fan to a modest exit velocity." />
