        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="REQUIRES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="A military aeroengine must have a small fan diameter to maximize speed and acceleration." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="furthermore, the fan diameter must be small to prevent the engine protruding from the airframe so that speed and acceleration is maximised." />
