        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="INFLUENCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The bypass ratio of a modern civil turbofan is set to develop reasonable propulsive efficiency (ηprop)." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="These considerations explain why a modern civil turbofan aeroengine has a bypass ratio between 6:1 and perhaps 9:1 to develop reasonable ηprop and SFC." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-2" />
