        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_IMPROVEMENT_OVER" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The development from SRR99 to CMSX-4 is part of a trend of creating alloys with increasing creep resistance." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="the shift towards the right as one moves from SRR99, CMSX-4 to RR3000 has arisen due to the metallurgists who have been able to produce alloys of increasing creep resistance" />
