        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="HAS_SUPERIOR_RUPTURE_LIFE_TO" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The rupture life of the third-generation alloy RR3000 (2500h) is ten times longer than the first-generation alloy SRR99 (250h) under conditions of 850°C/500 MPa." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="ed from about 250h at 850°C/500 MPa for a typical first-generation alloy such as SRR99, to about 2500h for the third-generation alloy RR3000." />
