          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_EXAMPLE_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Waspaloy is mentioned as an example of a polycrystalline superalloy." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Polycrystalline superalloys such as Waspaloy are less good in creep, but their behaviour exceeds that of many other alloy systems." />
