        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="REDUCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Ti reduces SiO2 to metallic Si." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Impurities of SiO2 can cause problems, since Ti reduces it to metallic Si which will be incorporated into the ingot." />
