        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="EXPLAINED_BY" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The strengthening effect of the y' phase is explained by the theory of order strengthening." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="First, theory for order strengthening by distributions of the y' phase is presented." />
