          <attvalue for="11" value="ENABLES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Respecting the four guidelines has led to improvements in performance." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="With the benefit of hindsight, the improvements in performance have been won by respecting the four guidelines set out on pp. 152-170." />
