        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="PROMOTES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="A significant γ' fraction promotes the state of strong coupling." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...and particularly when the γ' fraction is significant, the superpartials usually reside in the same γ' precipitate and are then said to be 'strongly coupled'." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-4" />
