        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="YIELDS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The formula Gb/l, with the given parameters for G, b, and l, yields a stress of 125 MPa." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="With G = 50 GPa, b = 0.25 nm and 1 = 100 nm, this yields 125 MPa." />
