        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="APPLIED_TO" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The discussion about the need for precise temperature control during heat treatment is in the context of the CMSX-4 superalloy." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Figure 3.30 shows a prediction of the phase stability of the CMSX-4 superalloy around the melting temperature. The solutioning window is about 50°C, which is rather small; this emphasises the need for precise temperature control during heat treatment." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-5" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="chunk-c26d17a0082c516bc0b48b307c73e551" />
          <attvalue for="17" value="0.26666666666666666" />
