          <attvalue for="12" value="White spots are solute-lean regions that appear bright or white after etching." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Defects known as white spots are solute-lean regions which lack the hardening phases γ' and y&quot; and the associated hardening elements such as Al, Ti and Nb" />
