        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="PRODUCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Machining to a pre-specified geometry results in the component being in the 'condition of supply'." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Next, the discs are machined to a pre-specified geometry which is known as the 'condition of supply'" />
