        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_A" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The 'condition of supply' is a rectilinear forging, which is the state of the component before final machining." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...this is usually rectilinear to allow non-destructive evaluation (NDE) of the forging via ultrasonic testing. Finally, the rectilinear forging is machined..." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-6" />
