          <attvalue for="11" value="ENABLES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The rectilinear shape of the forging allows for non-destructive evaluation to be performed." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...this is usually rectilinear to allow non-destructive evaluation (NDE) of the forging via ultrasonic testing." />
