          <attvalue for="12" value="Soluble-gas atomisation is induced by inserting a ceramic tube into the melt." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="A number of variants of the process have been developed with varying degrees of success, for example, soluble-gas atomisation in which atomisation is induced by inserting a ceramic tube into the melt" />
