          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_PROPERTY_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Fatigue crack growth rate is a property studied in the material IN100." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="ated work on IN100 [28] has demonstrated a considerable influence of environment on the fatigue crack growth rate" />
