        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IMPROVED_AT" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The improvement in fatigue life for the fine-grained material was most substantial at 425 °C." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Interestingly, the fatigue life for the fine-grained material (ASTM 11) was improved more substantially at 425 °C" />
