        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DEPENDS_ON" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The accuracy of the fatigue life estimation is dependent on having a good estimate of the particle size distribution." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="the accuracy of the fatigue life depends upon it and, indeed, no estimate is possible if this is unavailable." />
