          <attvalue for="12" value="Li, Ashbaugh and Rosenberger [27] examined the fracture surfaces of IN100." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Li, Ashbaugh and Rosenberger [27] have characterised these effects by examining the fracture surfaces of IN100 under LCF conditions" />
