          <attvalue for="12" value="The measurement of crack growth rate was performed at a temperature of 620 °C." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="at 620 °C with R = 0.15 and a 30 s dwell at the peak load, a decrease in the vacuum from 1 to 10-8 atm produced an order of magnitude decrease in the crack growth rate." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-4" />
