        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="REDUCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The characteristics of coarse-grained material lead to a reduction in the sensitivity of flaw detection." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="the background noise is found to be significantly greater for coarse-grained material, and therefore the sensitivity of flaw detection is then much reduced" />
