        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_A" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="N18 is a type of powder disc superalloy, which is a sub-category of turbine disc superalloys." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Most of the alloy development work for turbine disc superalloys has been carried out... When designing the powder disc superalloy N18..." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-6" />
