        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_A" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Rene 95 is implicitly categorized as a stronger alloy, as its example is used to illustrate the conclusion about stronger alloys." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="However, for Rene 95, life-to-first crack is 8300 cycles, which is well beyond two-thirds of dysfunction. It is clear that the risk associated with the life-to-first-crack approach is greater when the alloy is stronger." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-2" />
