        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DERIVED_FROM" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The calculation of the critical crack size (acrit) uses the fracture toughness (K1c) value." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="For most nickel-based superalloys, the fracture toughness, K1c, is about 100 MPam¹/²; if we assume Ar is equal to 800 MPa, with failure occurring at the top of the cycle, one obtains acrit = 11 mm." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-6" />
