          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_DEFINED_BY" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The stress intensity range (ΔK) is defined in part by the geometry factor Υ." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Upon inserting the expression for ∆Κ = Υ∆σ√πa, and after performing the appropriate integration, one has" />
