        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_USED_IN" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The determination of the variation of No is a step in performing quantitative calculations." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="With this model, quantitative calculations can be carried out in the following way. First, the variation of No with flaw size, d, is determined" />
