          <attvalue for="11" value="OPERATES_AT" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The model makes its indication at a given probability of failure." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="At any given probability of failure, the model indicates that the inclusion which is the likeliest to cause failure has a size which depends upon the surface to volume ratio." />
