        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="ENABLES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Overlay coatings allow the attainment of desired surface properties like oxidation resistance, corrosion resistance, strength, and ductility." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="they allow the desired surface properties to be attained for any given application, for example with an optimum blend of oxidation and corrosion resistances, strength and ductility." />
