        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="HAS_DETRIMENTAL_EFFECT_ON" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The application of the Ni–20Cr–12Al–Y overlay coating was found to be detrimental to the VJL12U superalloy, reducing its life during LCF testing." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="application of a Ni–20Cr–12Al–Y overlay coating by the EB-PVD method was found to be detrimental (see Figure 5.33), with the reduction in life being more pronounced when testing was carried out at 20 °C rather than 800 °C" />
