        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IMPROVES_ADHERENCE_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Yttrium (Y) is added to improve the adherence of the Al2O3 layer." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="The reason is the so-called 'reactive element effect' [68] by which the adherence of the Al2O3" />
