          <attvalue for="12" value="Yttrium is a component of the Y/S ratio, which is critical for adhesion." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="By considering alloys with various levels of yttrium doping, the critical Y/S ratio for adhesion was found to be ~1:1 atomic, or 3:1 by weight." />
