        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="PROMOTES_FORMATION_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Interdiffusion promotes the formation of the secondary reaction zone (SRZ), particularly in third-generation single-crystal superalloys." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Particularly for the third-generation single-crystal superalloys which are rich in Re, interdiffusion promotes the formation of a 'secondary reaction zone' (SRZ) beneath the interdiffusion zone (IDZ) [91,92]" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-4" />
