        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="CAUSES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The formation of the SRZ causes recrystallisation of the γ/γ' structure." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="thus, SRZ formation causes recrystallisation of the γ/γ' structure, but it has been demonstrated that there is no significant texture induced [92]." />
