        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_COMPONENT_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The β–NiAl phase is a major component of aluminide coatings." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="In view of the high fraction of the β–NiAl phase in aluminide coatings, emphasis has been placed on elucidating the mechanism of Al2O3 formation..." />
