        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="FORMS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Pure β–NiAl is prone to forming metastable cubic aluminas, particularly at temperatures below 1050 °C, when water vapour is present, or when the oxygen partial pressure is low." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="It has become clear that pure β–NiAl is prone to the formation of metastable cubic (otherwise known as 'transition') aluminas such as γ, 8 or 0−Al2O3, particularly at temperatures below 1050 °C, when water vapour is present and/or when the oxygen partial pressure is low [94]." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-1" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="chunk-de80f6907a699addef0ea7d8827deb59" />
          <attvalue for="16" value="8.94854586129754e-05" />
