        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="TRANSFORMATION_BEGINS_AT" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The transformation of ic aluminas to a-Al2O3 begins at the metal-oxide interface." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="However, transformation to the equilibrium a-Al2O3 is always observed to occur rapidly thereafter, beginning at the metal-oxide interface." />
