        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DEFINES_FAILURE_CRITERION_FOR" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The concept of a 'critical thickness' of the TGO (δc) is used as a criterion for TBC failure." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Early work [136] made use of the notion of a 'critical thickness' of the TGO for TBC failure, termed δc, for TBC failure" />
