        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="RELATED_TO" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The ratio of sub-critical TGO thickness (δ) to critical thickness (δc) is a quantity that can be related to the life consumed." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="the ratio δ/δc (where δ is the sub-critical TGO thickness) is then a quantity that can be related (by a suitable functional form) to the life consumed." />
