        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_NOT_BASED_ON" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The approach that relates a quantity to life consumed is not fundamentally based upon the principles of fracture mechanics." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Unfortunately, this kind of approach is not fundamentally based upon the principles of fracture mechanics;" />
