          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_INDEPENDENT_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The energy release rate (Go) becomes independent of the crack length (b) once its length exceeds several layer thicknesses." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="the energy release rate, Go, approaches a steady-state, becoming independent of the crack length, b, once its length exceeds several layer thicknesses" />
