          <attvalue for="12" value="The edge-delamination regime is a condition under which failure of the TBC is predicted to occur." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="However, should h be increased by a factor of about 2 – so that one moves from the fail-safe to the edge-delamination regime of Figure 5.54 – then failure is predicted to occur." />
