          <attvalue for="12" value="Equation 5.3 provides the formula to calculate the value of the compressive stress (σc) that causes buckling." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="it undergoes buckling when the compressive stress, σc, in the coating attains a value σc = (π² / 12) * (E|| / (1 - ν²)) * (h/b)² (5.3)" />
