        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="CORRELATES_WITH" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="A strong correlation exists between the creep rupture life of the superalloys and their cost." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="A strong correlation exists between creep rupture life and cost, largely on account of the significant fractions of Re and Ru in the latest alloys" />
