          <attvalue for="11" value="DISPLAYS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The latest alloys display the very best creep resistance." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="it can be seen that the very best creep resistance is displayed by alloys with raw material costs of about five times that of the first-generation alloys." />
