        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="AFFECTS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="An alloying element is unlikely to improve all properties simultaneously, with stability being one of the affected properties." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Also of relevance is that any one alloying element is unlikely to improve all properties simultaneously, for example, Ru improves stability but increases cost, Re improves high-temperature strength but increases density, Cr improves corrosion resistance but degrades stability, etc." />
