        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="OCCURS_IN" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Creep degradation processes are phenomena studied in the context of single-crystal superalloys." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="For the single-crystal superalloys, the effects of alloying additions on the various creep degradation processes, for example, th" />
