        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="EMPLOYS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Superalloy development work has placed much emphasis on trial-and-error experimentation." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Much emphasis has been placed on trial-and-error experimentation and screening trials, which have tended to be costly and time-consuming." />
