        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="HAS_PROPERTY_IN_DIRECTION" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="In the (111) direction, pure nickel has a Young's Modulus of 294 GPa and is at its stiffest." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...(111) the stiffest... The values are ... E(111) = 294 GPa." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-2" />
