        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DOES_NOT_PRODUCE" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The formation of a superlattice extrinsic stacking fault (SESF) does not produce nearest-neighbour violations." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="As with the SISF fault, no nearest-neighbour violations are produced, so the fault energy is low." />
