        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="MAXIMIZES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The objective is to find the specific transition metal that maximizes the suggested merit criterion." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Suggest a merit criterion for turbine blade applications, and find the transition metal which maximises it." />
