        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="EXHIBITS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Ni is described as displaying a fair degree of anisotropy." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Thus, whilst Ni displays a fair degree of anisotropy, it is not the most anisotropic of FCC metals." />
