          <attvalue for="12" value="The mechanism involving directional and incompressible Ni-Re bonds is the probable reason for the significant effect of Re on superalloys." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="It is probable that this is the reason why Re has such a significant effect on the high-temperature properties of the superalloys." />
