        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="CONSISTS_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Every second plane in the {200} family is composed solely of Ni atoms." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...one way to realise this is to consider the {200} planes, every second one of which consists solely of Ni atoms." />
