        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="EXPLAINS_PROPERTY_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The structure of the {200} planes is used as a way to understand the bonding behavior on the {001} plane." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="...one way to realise this is to consider the {200} planes, every second one of which consists solely of Ni atoms." />
