        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="EXHIBITS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Ni3Al, in particular, displays the anomalous yield effect." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="f lock is central to our understanding of the anomalous yield effect displayed by L12 compounds and Ni3Al in particular." />
