        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_FUNCTION_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The APB energy is a function of the ordering energy Ω." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="The APB energy on the {111} plane is then 2Ω/(a²√3), where Ω is the ordering energy" />
