        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="PROMOTES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="A relatively high APB energy leads to the state of strong coupling." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Since the associated APB energy is relatively high... the superpartials ... are then said to be 'strongly coupled'." />
