          <attvalue for="11" value="CONTAINS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Paired dislocations consist of two dislocations, one of which is the second trailing dislocation." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="consequently, the second trailing dislocation is some way behind the first" />
