        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="INTRODUCES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The first dislocation is responsible for introducing the Antiphase Boundary (APB)." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="The terms F₁ and F₂ are of opposite signs since the first dislocation introduces the APB" />
