          <attvalue for="11" value="CONTROLS" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The behaviour of the leading dislocation controls the onset of particle shearing." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Figure 2.45 indicates that the onset of particle shearing is controlled by the behaviour of the leading dislocation..." />
