        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="INDICATES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Figure 2.45 indicates that the onset of particle shearing is controlled by the leading dislocation's behaviour." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Figure 2.45 indicates that the onset of particle shearing is controlled by the behaviour of the leading dislocation, which will, in practice, be held up by closely spaced, larger particles." />
