          <attvalue for="11" value="IMPEDES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The leading dislocation is held up by closely spaced, larger particles." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="It must bow in order to overcome the pinning forces due to the particles, i.e. to develop a component of the line tension in a direction opposite to" />
