        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="USES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The derivation of Equation (2.28d) makes use of Equation (2.27)." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="or, making use of Equation (2.27), λ₁ = (2T/F)¹/² × (2π/(3f))¹/² × r₁ (2.28d)" />
