        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DERIVED_FROM" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="Equation (2.29) is the result of inserting Equation (2.28d) into Equation (2.24) and setting F." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="inserting Equation (2.28d) into Equation (2.24) and placing F equal to 2γAPB r₁. The result is as follows: τc = (γAPB / 2b) * [((6γAPBrf) / (πT))¹/² − f] (2.29)" />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-3" />
