        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="MODIFIES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The factor [(6γAPBfr/(πT))¹/² − f] modifies the first estimate of the cutting stress, which is γAPB/b." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="One can see that the factor [(6γAPBfr/(πT))¹/² − f] modifies the first estimate of γAPB/b for the cutting stress." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-6" />
