        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="HAS_DEPENDENCE" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The critical resolved shear stress (τc) is proportional to the square root of the volume fraction (f), as shown by the approximation τc ∝ (fr)¹/²." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Thus, significant fractions of larger particles are expected to promote hardening." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-2" />
