        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="IS_FUNCTION_OF" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="τc is a function of the antiphase boundary energy (γAPB) as part of the approximation formula (6γAPB fr/(πT))¹/²." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="In practice, for large particles, (6γAPB fr/(πT))¹/² » f so that, to a good approximation, τc ∝ (fr)¹/²." />
          <attvalue for="14" value="r-8" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="chunk-c026408b0eb125d3c56d1ed05d0a0f15" />
