        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="11" value="DETERMINES" />
          <attvalue for="12" value="The magnitude of the repulsive force R determines the critical value of τ." />
          <attvalue for="13" value="Thus one can see that the magnitude of the repulsive force R determines the critical value of τ required for particle shearing." />
